453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 223 0 R
/E (The proposed DMO-PSO algorithm will be compared with flood-constrained Greedy Nearest-Neighbor baselines using total transit distance, urgency-weighted arrival latency, and Constraint Satisfaction Rate \(CSR\). Unconstrained GNN routes will be assessed for flood constraint violations. Computational evaluation will examine convergence stability, hazard-depth sensitivity, and execution and re-optimization runtime. Multiple independent DMO-PSO trials will use controlled random seeds and consistent inputs under matched experimental conditions.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
